                                "sense_id": "6f0e298e-e9bb-3237-8c65-9b74bbc45398",
                                "text": "The blackbirds and robins and and^([sic]) tits and finches shout at each other, chups and warbles and chirrups that, loosely translated, mean “Fancy a shag?”, “Get OFF my land” or “I’ve got a great big tonker.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
